    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The three-bedroom duplex at Mount Auburn Park offers the space and separation of a house within a beautifully designed contemporary residence.\r\n\r\nThe principal living level features a generous kitchen and dining area opening onto a terrace, together with a separate living room — providing distinct spaces for entertaining and relaxing with its spectacular outlook across Dublin Bay, with expansive views creating an ever-changing backdrop to everyday living and entertaining. A guest WC, utility and storage complete this level.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three bedrooms provide excellent private accommodation. Bedroom 1 benefits from its own en-suite, with Bedrooms 2 and 3 served by the main bathroom.\r\n\r\nAt approximately 126 sq.m / 1,360 sq.ft, the duplex provides an exceptional amount of space and a highly practical layout in an exclusive Killiney setting."
      },
